    "pin": {
      "title": "Dunure Castle",
      "description": "Castle in South Ayrshire, Scotland",
      "extract": "Dunure Castle is located on the west coast of Scotland, in South Ayrshire, about five miles south of Ayr and close to the village of Dunure. Today the castle stands in ruins on a rocky promontory on the Carrick coast, overlooking the small harbour of Dunure.",
